@startuml getForwardingConstructListAsync
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title
getForwardingConstructListAsync – Retrieve All Forwarding-Construct Instances
end title

participant "requestor" as requestor
participant "ForwardingDomain" as fdRes #LightCyan
participant "JSON Driver" as jd #LightYellow
participant "config.json" as cfg #LightGrey

note over requestor
end note

requestor -> fdRes: (none)
activate fdRes

fdRes -> jd: read forwarding-domain list
activate jd

jd <-> cfg: retrieve control-construct
jd --> fdRes: list of all forwarding-constructs
deactivate jd

note over fdRes
  <u>Processing</u>
  - Iterate through all forwarding-construct instances
  - Return array of forwarding-constructs
  - Return empty array if none exist
end note

fdRes --> requestor: List of forwardingConstruct objects | []
deactivate fdRes

@enduml
